==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Phantom Forces|Gligar|46}} from the {{TCG|Phantom Forces}} expansion.
*'''Pierce''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Kabuto|39}} and {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Anorith|27}}, both from the {{TCG|EX Sandstorm}} expansion.
